WEBVTT

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:59.160
Five years already.

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:16.600
Hey! Shirogane!

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:20.470
What are you going to do about this!?

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:31.240
Pervert! Hentai! Idiot! Stupid! Shirogane, Ecchi!

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.320
You’re the one who’s peeping!

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.870
And what do you want from me first thing in the morning?

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:44.800
Oh umm, that is...

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:46.170
What was it?

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:48.960
If you’ve forgotten then go to school.

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:50.210
Oh! I’ve remembered!

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:52.000
It’s about transforming into a cat!

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.340
Somethings wrong with transforming into a cat?

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:59.170
There’s more than
“something wrong”!

00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:01.850
I’m in trouble because I’m turning
into a cat more often now!

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:08.560
In the beginning I didn’t turn into
one unless I was properly kissed,

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.560
but these days I turn into one
just by being licked by a dog!

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:14.520
If things stay like this,
I’ll never be his bride!

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:17.200
You’re getting married? Who to?

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:23.030
T-That has nothing to do with you!

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:28.540
F-Furthermore, it’s none of your business
who I’m going to get married to!

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:30.750
Privacy, huh?

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:31.590
Exactly!

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:35.630
Then I’d like you to respect my privacy as well.

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:36.710
Huh?

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:38.250
I’m going to change,

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:39.510
so would you get out?

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:44.020
T-Then I’ll be downstairs, okay?

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:51.190
He’s just too good at
dodging questions.

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:53.230
Why hello, Ichigo-san.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.610
Oh, Akasaka-san, good morning!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.900
Why are you here so early? Anything wrong?

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:00.940
I’m waiting for Shirogane.

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:03.950
I can’t go to school until I give him a piece of my mind!

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.660
If it’s Ryou you want,
he’s already left.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:09.080
He did what?!

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:15.630
For crying out loud, what’s with him?

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.220
Yay! Iguana! Huh!?

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:33.730
Ah! Iguana!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:37.860
Huh? I thought there was a girl here just now.

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:39.200
That’s weird.

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.240
Oh no, I transformed again!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.910
I have to hurry and transform back.

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:49.370
I have to look for someone to kiss...

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:49.960
Huh?

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:51.080
There!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.250
That over there’ll do.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.010
Please spare my life!

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.340
Are you male or female?

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:08.470
Um, I’m female.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:09.810
But what about it?

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.310
Oh, really...?

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:36.460
I’ve become very good at catching small animals lately...

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:39.580
What sort of person am I,
being able to do that...

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:42.010
Yay! Iguana!

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.050
Let’s go home! Huh!?

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.280
Again!? Won’t this thing
just lay off!?

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:01.450
Huh?

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:04.990
Ah! Yes!

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.910
She’ll do!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.370
That gave me a shock.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:16.040
Hey there, lady!

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.290
Oww...

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:20.070
Hey!

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:20.590
Sorry...

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:24.910
So, you’re the female cat who’s
been going round recently,

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:28.550
attacking small innocent animals
and forcing kisses on them?

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:29.430
Eh... err...

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:33.890
You’ve got a lot of guts
to go after my girl.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.640
You’d better be prepared!

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:39.610
Well, there’s a good reason
for all of this...

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.570
No excuses!

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:52.530
M-My eyes... The pain-n-n!

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:57.040
Darling, darling, get a hold of yourself! Darling!

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:56.380
Alto.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.450
C’mon, we’re going!

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:00.460
Oh, uhh...

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:06.850
We’ll be fine here.

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:11.430
See ya.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:12.970
Yep, thank you.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:17.140
Oh yeah, you’re the kissing
maniac, right?

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:20.150
What?

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:29.160
See ya.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:38.330
Alto, what’s with you?

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:41.500
Apart from anything else,

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:45.300
why do you always save me when I’m in trouble?

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.930
You’re like the Blue Knight.

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:51.470
That can’t be true.

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:55.100
I’m always troubling you.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:59.100
I’ll treat you to a can of
cat food, so let’s go.

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:05.480
It’s at the limit...

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.530
Huh? What?

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.680
I’m out of time.

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:40.680
Shi-Shi-Shi...

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:42.020
Shirogane!?

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.440
Yo, are you doing good?

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.820
Just kidding.

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:54.410
Well, <i>that</i>’s what’s with me.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:57.410
Can’t do much now you’ve found out.

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.750
No way, Shirogane’s...

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.250
Alto!?

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:17.520
Ichigo, Ichigo, are you OK?

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:23.350
Why? Shirogane is Alto?

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.050
Thank you for waiting.

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:31.570
There’s no time to show off!

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.870
Ichigo, why are you spacing out?

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.450
Come on, you have to go and help, remember?

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.420
Why’s Shirogane...?

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:55.390
Yo, working hard?

00:08:57.630 --> 00:08:58.760
What do I do?

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:02.430
If I leave it like this, I won’t even be able to look him in the eyes anymore.

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.810
Ichigo-san? Ichigo-san?

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:16.580
There you go.

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:20.330
Um, Akasaka-san...

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:25.210
Is Ryou the reason why your smile is clouded?

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.170
I heard you saw him...

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:32.880
I’m sorry for hiding it from you all this time.

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:35.840
Ryou wouldn’t let me tell you.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:38.810
But please understand this,

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:44.810
It’s his style to stay quiet and
not to let you all get worried.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:48.810
I sort of understand, but...

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:50.770
It happened 5 years ago.

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:54.770
Back then, I was working in America...

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:58.740
as an assistant to Dr. Shirogane...
Ryou’s father.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:02.070
He was a famous archaeologist, ...

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:05.330
but after he found a certain ruin...

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:09.960
he secretly started researching to unravel the technology of the unidentified species.

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.670
I see. Ryou mentioned that.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.630
Yes. He was reading your research log eagerly...

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:19.180
...when he said that he’d follow in your footsteps and become a scientist.

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:24.730
Unlike me, he is a true genius with an IQ of over 180.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.690
He could do anything he put his mind to.

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:34.610
And yet, I wouldn’t like him to become like me...

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:36.190
Doctor...

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:38.570
Experiments that cannot see the light of day...

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:42.370
If we hadn’t found those ruins...

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:45.230
If we didn’t learn that a civilization other than humans existed...

00:10:45.230 --> 00:10:48.580
...and created things such as a “chimera”...

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:54.510
and we hadn’t realized the danger
that they can still inflict on us...

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:58.840
Hey Johnny!

00:10:58.840 --> 00:10:59.590
OK!

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:08.690
Hey, genius boy.

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:24.030
If you keep coming home like this,
someday I’ll become a real doctor.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.360
What can I do?

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:27.910
They’re the ones starting it.

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:29.710
Here, give me your arm.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.120
What’s so funny?

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:35.340
I’m happy.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:37.210
About my unhappiness?

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:39.210
No!

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:43.090
I’m just really happy to have a son
who gives me so many problems.

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:44.720
What’s that?

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.890
Just don’t move.

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.140
You’re not going to scold me?

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:50.180
Why?

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:54.650
Because mothers usually scold their children when they get into a fight, don’t they?

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:56.440
I won’t scold you.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:57.200
Why?

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:00.780
Because you aren’t in the wrong, are you?

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:03.400
I have a mother who doesn’t give me problems.

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:05.080
Let’s just say I trust you.

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:05.620
Here!

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:08.490
Hey, that hurts!

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:10.330
It’s because you moved.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:15.080
Let Ryou go to a university, you say?

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:20.420
Yes, that might be impossible in Japan,
but isn’t it natural here in America?

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:24.470
I wouldn’t mind, but I’m not sure if he wants it himself.

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:29.230
He’s too intelligent and is already isolated in that school.

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:34.520
Forcing him to continue and to stay
in school might not be a good idea.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:38.280
Are parents’ dreams for their children always in vain?

00:12:39.810 --> 00:12:43.200
I wonder where he got
his unsociable ways.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:45.070
I wouldn’t know.

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:48.530
Loneliness comes with being a genius, I suppose...

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.250
Akasaka-kun?

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:52.000
Yes?

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.960
Would you become his friend?

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.130
That’s impossible.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:02.180
I’m already friends with him.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:03.680
I see.

00:13:15.430 --> 00:13:18.990
If you go to university you’d find more people to talk to.

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:22.030
You’ll probably learn a few technical terms though.

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:26.400
Hey, Keiichirou, why are you helping Dad’s research?

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:28.620
Who knows why?

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:32.290
You have so much ability yourself,

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:34.580
you should be able to get a lab
of your own, don’t you think?

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:38.670
My research title right now is
“The Best Way to Serve Tea...

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:43.840
and The Scientific Analysis of Teacup Curves”.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:47.440
You’re always avoiding
questions like this.

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:49.800
Besides,

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.970
the doctor is a very
charming person.

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:05.650
What? What’s that noise?

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:07.370
I don’t know.

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:08.750
But the sound is coming from...

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:10.090
Look!

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:12.870
Somewhere near our house!

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:13.950
Let’s hurry!

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:36.450
Papa...

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:37.480
Mama...

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.390
It’s dangerous!

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:45.960
Papa!

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:47.830
Mama!

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:49.540
Ryou, you mustn’t!

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:50.700
Let go!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:53.160
Papa and Mama are in there!

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:55.780
Let me go!

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:57.080
I have to help them!

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:59.710
LET GO!!!

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:03.460
That’s...

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:44.080
It looks like everything burned to the ground.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.260
Everything...

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:50.390
It hasn’t burned down.

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:54.800
I will take over my father’s research.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:16:00.140
I’ll go to Japan, where I’ll perfect my
father’s project... the Mew Project!

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:02.100
Ryou...

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:03.780
I remember...

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:06.860
I remember everything
in the research log.

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.820
I do remember...

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.130
So then Ryou and I
returned to Japan,

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:36.890
and completed the Mew Project, which must have been Dr. Shirogane’s last wishes.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.600
It’s finally done.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:43.060
Now we have only to use it on the girls.

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:46.060
Is this really safe?

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:48.600
How can you say that,
after all the tests?

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:52.570
You are the one who knows best
how perfect our research is.

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:57.700
Ryou! What are you trying to...

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:02.540
Keiichirou, I entrust the rest of the research to you.

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:05.750
This is the last experiment.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:23.890
Ryou!

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:27.410
You must have a specific gene type to use this,

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:30.220
or you’ll just be turned into an animal!

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:34.740
You know that too well, yet still...

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:46.500
We have now completed all the experiments.

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:54.570
Now I will start the Mew Project.

00:17:56.690 --> 00:18:01.660
Since then Ryou has been able to
transform into a cat and back.

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:05.610
Although, if he stays a cat for more than 10 minutes,

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:08.560
he can never return to human form.

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:14.530
He became the test subject himself to
verify your safety in the Mew Project.

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:20.760
So he is... always trying
to protect us, is he?

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:23.500
He wouldn’t say anything in front
of you and the others,

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:28.940
but he’s always saying that he’d protect all of you.

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:30.830
I didn’t know.

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:37.410
I didn’t know that, and I’ve said
nasty things to him so often...

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:38.760
Don’t misunderstand...

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:43.490
I’m the one who is responsible for you getting involved.

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:45.930
I’m just doing the right thing.

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:52.350
B-But I didn’t know that all of that happened to you, so...

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:56.690
I feel sorry for you, Shirogane...

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:12.800
Idiot! Now isn’t the time to feel sorry for me!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:22.140
We are sorry. If you wouldn’t mind,
I’d like to help you to return to normal.

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:27.180
You guys...

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:40.680
Shirogane!

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:41.400
Hmm?

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:47.080
I’ll never... I’ll never ever
feel pity for you!

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:49.870
That’s a good thought.

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:56.960
But... I’ll do my best.

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:07.210
It’s because I found out that Shirogane’s serious.

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:09.660
So I’ll do my best!

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:12.850
I believe that’s all I can do for now!

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:22.860
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:28.130
My first Christmas with Aoyama-kun!

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:31.430
My most memorable Christmas,
only once in my life!

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.950
Christmas... filled with happiness!

00:20:33.950 --> 00:20:35.680
It’s supposed to be like that, but...

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:39.560
Aoyama-kun doesn’t know I’m a Mew Mew.

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:40.480
What should I do?

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:45.210
If he looks straight into my eyes.
my cat ears will pop out again!

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:49.680
Next, “Shining Tears:
Christmas with the Two of Us”

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:53.450
Aoyama kun, I want to look straight
back into your eyes, but...
